  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the barramundi fillets and cook for 3-4 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the gochujang and coconut cream.",
    "Pour the gochujang sauce over the barramundi and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped scallions, sesame seeds, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Serve the barramundi hot, garnished with additional scallions and sesame seeds if desired.",
    "Let it rest for a few minutes before serving."
  ],
